    {
        "id": 67,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  喂，喂？阿陈吗？你还在吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "喂，喂？阿陈吗？你还在吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 68,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 69,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你叫我什么？！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你叫我什么？！"
    },
    {
        "id": 70,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 71,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  阿陈啊。你完了！大古广场这事儿你死定了，我听得清清楚楚，你叫他们动手的！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "阿陈啊。你完了！大古广场这事儿你死定了，我听得清清楚楚，你叫他们动手的！"
    },
    {
        "id": 72,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 73,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你不会就想说这个吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你不会就想说这个吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 74,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 75,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  我说，你拒绝罗德岛的协助，是不是因为心里过意不去啊？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "我说，你拒绝罗德岛的协助，是不是因为心里过意不去啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 76,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 77,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  别揣测我的心思。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "别揣测我的心思。"
    },
    {
        "id": 78,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 79,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  没事，我会帮你弥补的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "没事，我会帮你弥补的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 80,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 81,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  弥补什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "弥补什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 82,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 83,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  哼哼，暂时还是个秘密。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "哼哼，暂时还是个秘密。"
    },
    {
        "id": 84,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  但大古广场这事儿，你真的完蛋了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "但大古广场这事儿，你真的完蛋了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 85,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  对了，你记不记得上环有家茶餐厅？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "对了，你记不记得上环有家茶餐厅？"
    },
    {
        "id": 87,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 88,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  啊？哪家？哎不管是哪家，现在都关门了啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "啊？哪家？哎不管是哪家，现在都关门了啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 89,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  ——你是不是很想岔开话题？！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "——你是不是很想岔开话题？！"
    },
    {
        "id": 90,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 91,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  三文治里肉排很酥的那家。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "三文治里肉排很酥的那家。"
    },
    {
        "id": 92,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 93,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  哦？哦……哦！我想起来了！那家的茶餐厅，肉扒包是不是有两个手掌大！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "哦？哦……哦！我想起来了！那家的茶餐厅，肉扒包是不是有两个手掌大！"
    },
    {
        "id": 94,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 95,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  是啊。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "是啊。"
    },
    {
        "id": 96,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 97,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  以前巡逻的时候，我也经常往这家店跑呢……躺下！谁让你站起来了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "以前巡逻的时候，我也经常往这家店跑呢……躺下！谁让你站起来了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 98,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  啊！！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "啊！！"
    },
    {
        "id": 99,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  叫什么来着，“靓饮茶餐厅？”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "叫什么来着，“靓饮茶餐厅？”"
    },
    {
        "id": 100,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 101,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  对。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "对。"
    },
    {
        "id": 102,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 103,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  哼哼，我知道了，你是准备喊我饮茶，是不是？不过我们为什么不去点高档店？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "哼哼，我知道了，你是准备喊我饮茶，是不是？不过我们为什么不去点高档店？"
    },
    {
        "id": 104,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 105,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你的高档和我的高档区别很大。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你的高档和我的高档区别很大。"
    },
    {
        "id": 106,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 107,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  哎，我可以请你。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "哎，我可以请你。"
    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  诗小姐，我像那种人吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "诗小姐，我像那种人吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 111,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  你再这么叫我试试？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "你再这么叫我试试？"
    },
    {
        "id": 112,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 113,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  别介意，口误。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "别介意，口误。"
    },
    {
        "id": 114,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 115,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  你明摆着故意的啊！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "你明摆着故意的啊！"
    },
    {
        "id": 116,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 117,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  诗怀雅，其实我是觉得，如果这次我们不做好点，会对不起街坊邻居。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "诗怀雅，其实我是觉得，如果这次我们不做好点，会对不起街坊邻居。"
    },
    {
        "id": 118,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我们的事业仰仗着龙门，龙门也仰仗着我们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我们的事业仰仗着龙门，龙门也仰仗着我们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 119,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 120,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  有感而发也该适可而止吧，你早点把整合运动干掉，我们就能早点去喫茶。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "有感而发也该适可而止吧，你早点把整合运动干掉，我们就能早点去喫茶。"
    },
    {
        "id": 121,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 122,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你那里的战斗好像很激烈？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你那里的战斗好像很激烈？"
    },
    {
        "id": 123,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 124,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  啊，没事，我拿得住。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "啊，没事，我拿得住。"
    },
    {
        "id": 125,
        "raw": "[name=\"？？？\"]  快！他们要逃走了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "？？？",
        "content": "快！他们要逃走了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 126,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  烦人！喂，你们几个动作也快点！没时间了！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "烦人！喂，你们几个动作也快点！没时间了！"
    },
    {
        "id": 127,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  阿陈！我要番茄扒蛋堡！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "阿陈！我要番茄扒蛋堡！"
    },
    {
        "id": 128,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 129,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  没问题。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "没问题。"
    },
    {
        "id": 130,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  上次一不小心把你关在金库那事，我向你赔罪。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "上次一不小心把你关在金库那事，我向你赔罪。"
    },
    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  那也能是一不小心？！算了，你肯定是存心的！算了，早上那杯水我泼得很解气，两清了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "那也能是一不小心？！算了，你肯定是存心的！算了，早上那杯水我泼得很解气，两清了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  喂，阿陈。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "喂，阿陈。"
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  嗯？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "嗯？"
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  命最重要。不要为了眼前事把命搭上，你还有很多人可以依靠。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "命最重要。不要为了眼前事把命搭上，你还有很多人可以依靠。"
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  哼，是吗。谢谢你的忠告。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "哼，是吗。谢谢你的忠告。"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  你在这家茶餐厅门口了，也就说明你快到近卫局大楼了吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "你在这家茶餐厅门口了，也就说明你快到近卫局大楼了吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  对。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "对。"
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_empty\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_empty.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"诗怀雅\"]  祝你好运。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "诗怀雅",
        "content": "祝你好运。"
    },
